samples=12  throttle_active=0  clocks.sm spread=0.893491  max=45.0C  power=86.88W

NOT the same signal. A throttle bitmask is a set of CAUSES; clock frequency is a CONSEQUENCE. The GPU can sit at its boost ceiling with every throttle bit clear, and conversely show a throttle bit while the clock spread stays small.

